  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 203.14 Docket and Calendar of Hearings. The commission shall:\n\n(a) Maintain a docket of all proceedings pending before the commission;\n\n(b) Keep a complete record of all the proceedings of the commission, including all books, maps, documents, and papers filed with the commission, and orders issued by the commission;\n\n(c) Maintain a record of all petitions, complaints, applications, rulemakings, investigations, and any other matters before the commission;\n\n(d) Maintain a calendar of all hearings scheduled before the commission; and\n\n(e) Maintain a service list for each proceeding of parties or participants to the proceeding.\n\nSource. #2011, eff 5-4-82; ss by #2912, eff 11-26-84; ss by #4998, eff 11-26-90; ss by #6365, INTERIM, eff 11-18-96, EXPIRED: 3-18-97\n\nNew. #6559, eff 8-19-97, EXPIRED: 8-19-05\n\nNew. #8420, INTERIM, eff 8-23-05, EXPIRED: 2-19-06\n\nNew. #8657-A, eff 6-10-06\n\nNew. #14184, eff 1-24-25 (formerly Puc 202.02)",
